{"c":[{"name":"20261002T133226Z-cbf7abe12b1fb923","text":"Grounded fill withholds nearly everything (Jev confidence 0.4-0.7) unless the source window was the one focused just before the form; stage a visit first.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T133226Z-dcf0803ca75a2746","text":"Fill tests: caret-fixture's --gold frames are view frames; AX (reader and host) reports text fields 1 pt larger on every side, so match by AX frame.","type":"note"}]}
